VERDICT
============================================================================================
 - Moment relaxation: survival=mu(safe-cube); DEGREE-2 (Cauchy-Schwarz) closes COPRIME combs
   for meas(L_C)>6^{-r}; GCD>1 combs REDUCE (u=g t) to an r-speed comb {W_i/g} at large freq g,
   x-g equidistributes L_C => survival -> meas(cap safe(W_i/g))*meas(L_C) >= (1-r/7)meas > 0.
 - So multi-far r=2..6 REDUCES to ONE clean bound:  inf_{(13-r)-cores} meas(L_C) > 6^{-r}.
   Search: CLOSES all r with margins 1.9x (r=2) -> 14000x (r=6). EASY for r>=3; r=2 tight-ish.
 - This is OPEN-Q-108 on FEWER speeds (proven LRC(<=12)): the LONELY-MEASURE inf on (13-r)-cores,
   lower-dimensional & more tractable than the full 13-set inf. Rates = far-element decorrelation.
 - HONEST: min is a SEARCH min, not a proved inf; r>=3 margins make it robust, r=2 (1.9x) needs
   a real inf meas(L_C)>1/36 over 11-cores (tractable via LRC(12)). r>=7 = THM-573.
DONE.
